        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.poster.avif?t=1776429131\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.webm?t=1776429131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.mp4?t=1776429131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/ca75c4905f494c99d9096602696842ef.avif?t=1776429131\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTRA VERTIGO is a game about well... <strong>running</strong> and <strong>exploring</strong>. Be fast, be nimble and stay focused to get to the end as fast as you can. Modifiers and secrets will keep things fresh, go out there and explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make it quick and easy (perfectly on point for this game) :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewarded exploration</strong> with shortcuts, secret zones and easter eggs!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize the game</strong>, tailor the difficulty to your needs with a neat rewind and well placed checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add cool and cumulative modifiers</strong> to remix the game :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rave party mode with mesmerizing visuals and remixed musics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce gravity to get to new heights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An... Entity...? That will haunt you and try to make you fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it jazzy. Because jazz is cool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ducks. Way too much rubber ducks. (Yup. You can bounce on the bigger ones).</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A huge vertical level</strong> with both relaxing and demanding zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to understand</strong> but <strong>hard to master</strong> (good luck putting your name in the leaderboard).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/2fbd50399fc17e9cefe346dcea368862.avif?t=1776429131\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump and climb as high as possible. The finish line lies at the very top of this huge vertical level. We hope you are not afraid of heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility is important for us, so you will discover a wide array of customization options to tailor the game to your needs. Make it as easy or difficult as you want. Add a shadow, a cursor, checkpoints or even the ability to rewind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rewind can be set as unlimited, single use (per zone / per run) or disabled. It allows you to get back right before the previous jump, in case of an inconvenient fall...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints are... Well it's explicit. Those are checkpoints. Still want to know more? Well... You can also make them single use, unlimited or just disabled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/540704e11e6cc5a38c44a4c0d2512c95.poster.avif?t=1776429131\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/540704e11e6cc5a38c44a4c0d2512c95.webm?t=1776429131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/540704e11e6cc5a38c44a4c0d2512c95.mp4?t=1776429131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/6783906e80368556000768b4ad00f34e.avif?t=1776429131\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, indeed, you will fall. Quite a lot. Of course, your legs are pretty strong, there is no fall damage or anything like that. The only damage you get from falling is emotional, as the level scrolls in front of you, showing all the progress you are losing while falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe while falling you'll find fabulous secret places...! With terrifying heights and hard jumps... Perfect places to fall! Who knows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/275fe6a7b80725f37f6f6c839109198b.poster.avif?t=1776429131\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/275fe6a7b80725f37f6f6c839109198b.webm?t=1776429131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/275fe6a7b80725f37f6f6c839109198b.mp4?t=1776429131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/1ed8cd5897e46f2bb5883165aea3a796.avif?t=1776429131\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep running, keep climbing, keep falling, keep... retrying. Somewhere down the line you will succeed. It is only a matter of time, sweat and tears. Though, getting to the end of the level is only the beginning, as you can improve your time, discover new routes and find shortcuts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/6d33f8ca66c329766ede0099f33a291c.poster.avif?t=1776429131\" width=900 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/6d33f8ca66c329766ede0099f33a291c.webm?t=1776429131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/6d33f8ca66c329766ede0099f33a291c.mp4?t=1776429131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Come on... Ducks are waiting for you! They can't wait to see you fall... And the leaderboard is eager to receive your scores!</strong></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.poster.avif?t=1776429131\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.webm?t=1776429131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.mp4?t=1776429131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/ca75c4905f494c99d9096602696842ef.avif?t=1776429131\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTRA VERTIGO is a game about well... <strong>running</strong> and <strong>exploring</strong>. Be fast, be nimble and stay focused to get to the end as fast as you can. Modifiers and secrets will keep things fresh, go out there and explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make it quick and easy (perfectly on point for this game) :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewarded exploration</strong> with shortcuts, secret zones and easter eggs!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize the game</strong>, tailor the difficulty to your needs with a neat rewind and well placed checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add cool and cumulative modifiers</strong> to remix the game :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rave party mode with mesmerizing visuals and remixed musics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce gravity to get to new height